<dialog class="eve-login-dialog" id="eveLoginDialog" aria-labelledby="eveLoginTitle">
    <button class="eve-login-close" type="button" data-eve-login-close aria-label="Close login">×</button>
    <p class="eyebrow">GURISTAS.NET // ACCOUNT ACCESS</p>
    <h2 id="eveLoginTitle">Log in with EVE Online</h2>
    <p>Public field guides, campaign reports, ship tools and radio work without login. Sign in for your personal pilot record.</p>
    <p>Choose a character through CCP. Your EVE password stays with CCP. Account login requires these read-only permissions:</p>
    <ul><li><strong>NPC standings:</strong> show your Guristas relationships and progression.</li><li><strong>Faction warfare statistics:</strong> show enlistment, kills and victory points.</li><li><strong>Character skills:</strong> calculate standings and check hull prerequisites and relevant support skills.</li><li><strong>Killmails:</strong> verify player kills while you fly Guristas hulls and retain evidence for your combat achievements.</li><li><strong>Current location:</strong> compare travel to mission agents and insurgency systems.</li><li><strong>Current ship:</strong> recognize the hull you are flying without asking you to select one.</li><li><strong>Owned assets:</strong> identify available Guristas hulls and their recorded locations. Ownership does not confirm fitting or docking access.</li></ul>
    <p>CCP displays these permissions before approval. If you decline any required permission, you cannot log in. These permissions cannot change your character or perform actions in EVE.</p>
    <a href="/auth/start.php" class="eve-sso-button" aria-label="Continue to EVE Online sign in">
        <img src="https://web.ccpgamescdn.com/eveonlineassets/developers/eve-sso-login-black-large.png" alt="Log in with EVE Online" width="240" height="48">
    </a>
    <p class="eve-login-note">You can review the requested access before you approve it with CCP.</p>
</dialog>
